  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place the beets into a saucepan, cover with water, and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low, and gently boil the beets until tender, about 45 minutes. Remove from heat, allow the beets to cool, and peel. Shred the beets using a box grater.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "In a salad bowl, mix the onion, salt, black pepper, vinegar, and sugar together lightly until thoroughly combined and the sugar has dissolved; mix in beets, chill, and serve.",
